From IFinlayson-Uo7VPy49NVNaa/9Udqfwiw at public.gmane.org  Mon Jan  7 16:23:14 2013
From: IFinlayson-Uo7VPy49NVNaa/9Udqfwiw at public.gmane.org (Finlayson, Ian)
