>>>>         in R,
>>>>         especially in factorial designs with more than 1 factor.
>>>>         For example, I
>>>>         did a structural priming study in a 2*2 design. So I have
>>>>         the two
>>>>         independent factors A and B (each with two levels), and
>>>>         Response as a
>>>>         two-level dependent variable (DO or PO response). I did the
>>>>         following
>>>>         analysis (ignoring random effects).
>>>>
>>>>         **************
>>>>         Formula: Response ~ A * B + (1 | Subject) + (1 | Item)
>>>>
>>>>         Fixed effects:
>>>>         Estimate Std. Error t value
>>>>         (Intercept) 1.26750 0.05435 23.322
>>>>         A2 0.29736 0.03784 7.859
