>>>>         effect of A).
>>>>         Similarly, the B2 line refers to the difference between the
>>>>         intercept
>>>>         and A1B2 (that is, the main effect of B at the A1 level).
>>>>
>>>>         To further confirm this, I used relevel to change the level
>>>>         which the
