From dale.barr-Rvdaw4MAOY42EctHIo1CcQ at public.gmane.org  Sun Jan 20 21:28:28 2013
From: dale.barr-Rvdaw4MAOY42EctHIo1CcQ at public.gmane.org (Dale Barr)
Date: Sun, 20 Jan 2013 21:28:28 +0000
